      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Five windows, seven degrees in every one of them, and nothing left to add. You have not been handed a new shape since chapter 2, and you will not be handed one now — five shapes, learned once, filled in four times over, the same hand positions the whole way."
        }
      ]
    },
